      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPITAL AVENUE (2) settled close to the pace then took control and kept finding to score narrowly over 2240m at Swan Hill two weeks ago. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Steps up a level but she is up to the task. ATUA MAGIC NZ (4) comes here fresh from a third in a Listed feature won by Im No Trouble seven months ago over 1758m at Leeton. Drawn well and big run while fresh is on the cards. ARENDELLE (9) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when fifth at this track over 1740m. Must be included. ACHY BREAKY ARK (7) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him finish second over 1740m at this track.",
